  "description": "The server half of the S1000D WYSIWYG editor, as two calls on an ASP.NET Core application: AddS1kdEditor and MapS1kdEditor. Holds a CSDB and its open editing sessions, applies edit commands through S1kdTools.Core, checks a data module against the default BREX, and lays one out as a PDF. S1kdTools.Editor is the browser half and speaks this protocol.",
